<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Mining plans merger with Lepanto.</title>
<headline>Manila Mining plans merger with Lepanto.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A top official of gold miner Manila Mining Co said on Monday the company was considering a merger with Lepanto Consolidated Mining Co.</p>
<p>But Manila Mining has to turn around its finances first before negotiating for a merger with Lepanto, the official who did not want to be named, said.</p>
<p>The official is on the board of directors of both the firms.</p>
<p>&quot;We want both companies to get together when they are healthy,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>Lepanto mines gold as well as copper.</p>
</text>
